e type can be reestablished from the array in the beginning: launch "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"gettype"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"() and print \"Error occurred\" if there became some contradiction during the building of type. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"level":4},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" — "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/contest/190/problem/D"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Non-secret Cypher"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"First solution: Let's use the method of two pointers. For every number we will know how many times it occurs in the current segment ["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"l"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"]. For fixed "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"l"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" we increase "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" until "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"] occurs in the current segment less than "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"k"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" times. If "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"] occurs int the segment ["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"l"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"] "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"k"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" times, we add to the answer all segments ["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"l"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"t"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"] for all "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"t"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" >  = "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" and increase "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"l"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" (and do not forget to decrease the number of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"l"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"] in the current segment)."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"To keep the number of every value in the segment we can use "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"map"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" or compression of the coordinates. Also it's important not to forget that the maximal answer is "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/08d0da3c2d8ba99c46e41ba0450982fdc9a753742c7ce3d65721cd4ad07b748e.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", which doesn't fit in "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"int"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"Second solution: firstly, let's do the compression of the coordinates. For every value "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"X"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" we write the list of the positions "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" such that "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"] = "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"X"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":". Now using that we fill the array "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"] is the minimum index that segment ["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"]] contains "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"k"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" numbers equal to "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"] (obviosly, "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"]] = "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"]), if this index doesn't exist, then "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"] = "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" + 1."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"Let's find for every index "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" a minimal index "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"j"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" such that segment ["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"j"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"] contsins "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"k"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text"